  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "线圈上的电压之间的关系."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果线圈的电阻等于零，那么在任何时刻，导线内部电场",
        "的电场强度也应当等于零. 否则，根据欧姆定律，电流强度就",
        "会无限大. 电场强度等于零之所以可能，是因为交变磁场激发",
        "的涡旋电场的电场强度 $\\vec{E}_i$ 在每一点上都和库仑场的电场强",
        "度 $\\vec{E}_k$ 的绝对值相等，而方向相反，这个库仑场是由分布在电",
        "源接线柱和电路导线上的电荷在导体中形成的."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "从等式 $\\vec{E}_i=-\\vec{E}_k$ 中可得出，**移动单位正电荷涡旋场做的**",
        "**功（也就是自感电动势 $e_i$）与库仑场做的功大小相等而方向相**",
        "**反.** 考虑到库仑场做的功等于线圈两端的电压，可以写出：",
        "$e_i=-u$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当电流强度按照简谐规律变化时，",
        "$i=I_м\\cos\\omega t$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "自感电动势等于",
        "$e_i=-Li'=L\\omega I_м\\sin\\omega t$ （2.29）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为 $u=-e_i$，则线圈两端的电压可以这样求出：",
        "$u=-L\\omega I_м\\sin\\omega t=L\\omega I_м\\cos\\left(\\omega t+\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$",
        "$=U_м\\cos\\left(\\omega t+\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$ （2.30）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "其中 $U_м=L\\omega I_м$ 是电压振幅的大小."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，**线圈上电压的振荡比电流强度振荡超前** $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$. 或者也",
        "可以这样说，**电流强度振荡比电压振荡滞后** $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当线圈上的电压达到最大值时，电流强度等于零（图 42）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
